From: Folio <folio@localhost>
Subject: [PATCH] Room for 254 properties

RmlUi caps element properties at 128 including its own 97, and Folio's custom properties (line graph,
path, text reveal) fill the rest, so the next one registered fails with "Maximum number of allowed
properties exceeded". PropertyId is already a uint8_t, so the cap rises to 0xff, matching ShorthandId.
PropertyIdSet's bitset grows from 16 to 32 bytes.

Removable once upstream raises the cap or makes it configurable.

--- a/Include/RmlUi/Core/ID.h
+++ b/Include/RmlUi/Core/ID.h
@@ -169,7 +169,7 @@
 	FirstCustomId = NumDefinedIds,
 
 	// The maximum number of IDs. This limits the number of possible custom IDs to MaxNumIds - FirstCustomId.
-	MaxNumIds = 128
+	MaxNumIds = 0xff
 };
 
 enum class MediaQueryId : uint8_t {
